From: Pulsar Bot <pulsar@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] seccomp: add SECCOMP_RET_USER_NOTIF + notify addfd

Backport of seccomp user notification (SECCOMP_RET_USER_NOTIF) and
seccomp notify addfd (SECCOMP_IOCTL_NOTIF_ADDFD) from Linux 5.9,
ported to the e404 4.19 CAF base.

Adds:
  - SECCOMP_RET_USER_NOTIF action
  - struct seccomp_knotif / seccomp_kaddfd / notification
  - seccomp_notify_* file ops for the supervisor fd
  - SECCOMP_IOCTL_NOTIF_RECV/SEND/ID_VALID/ADDFD ioctls
  - SECCOMP_FILTER_FLAG_NEW_LISTENER flag
  - SECCOMP_GET_NOTIF_SIZES op

Required: 0000-task-fd-install.patch must be applied first.

The seccomp_filter struct is extended with notif + notify_lock + wqh.
FD installation on the supervised task uses task_fd_install() for
explicit fds and get_unused_fd_flags()/fd_install() for allocation.

Reconstructed and validated against e404 staging-bpf base.

